---
title: 发布日排期
---
gantt
    dateFormat HH:mm
    axisFormat %H:%M
    tickInterval 30minute
    todayMarker 10:15
    section 准备
        冻结代码 : milestone, freeze, 09:00, 0m
        构建与签名 : build, after freeze, 45m
        冒烟测试 : crit, smoke, after build, 30m
    section 发布
        灰度 10% : active, canary, after smoke, 40m
        全量发布并观察错误率与延迟指标 : after canary, 1h
        公告 : vert, 11:30, 0m
    click build href "https://example.com/build"
